{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "\u5982\u679c\u4e00\u751f\u53ea\u6709\u4e09\u5341\u5c81Before Thirty",
    "steam_appid": 1128360,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1128360/extras/e628b6a04d53a863672b0d0051e810d3.avif?t=1572510074\" /></div><br><br>This is a <strong>simulated story game with puzzles.</strong><br>It tells the story of a young man who knows that he has only ten years to live. He gradually accepts the reality and feels the process of life in confusion and struggle.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1128360/extras/d309b723bb4ea43db27e502151e63197.avif?t=1572510074\" /></div><br>When the hero learned that he was suffering from terminal illness, he was confused and helpless. Gradually he started to be inspirational to experience life. What will happen in the hero's life, and what ordinary but profound experiences will be?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The game tells the story with a variety of games.</strong></h2>Some are very simple, just like the life in peace with emotional expression.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1128360/extras/\u5207\u897f\u7ea2\u67ff001(1).gif?t=1572510074\" /></div><br><br>Some are little difficult, just like the constant struggle in life,  which needs to strive for victory.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1128360/extras/0aea396c4cc0b47c3acc281b94e46384.poster.avif?t=1572510074\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1128360/extras/0aea396c4cc0b47c3acc281b94e46384.webm?t=1572510074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1128360/extras/0aea396c4cc0b47c3acc281b94e46384.mp4?t=1572510074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">We hope that every player will have some insights in the end of the game.</h2></strong><br>If you have any comments or suggestions, join our QQ group 310126344 to balabala.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1128360/extras/e628b6a04d53a863672b0d0051e810d3.avif?t=1572510074\" /></div><br><br>This is a <strong>simulated story game with puzzles.</strong><br>It tells the story of a young man who knows that he has only ten years to live. He gradually accepts the reality and feels the process of life in confusion and struggle.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1128360/extras/d309b723bb4ea43db27e502151e63197.avif?t=1572510074\" /></div><br>When the hero learned that he was suffering from terminal illness, he was confused and helpless. Gradually he started to be inspirational to experience life. What will happen in the hero's life, and what ordinary but profound experiences will be?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The game tells the story with a variety of games.</strong></h2>Some are very simple, just like the life in peace with emotional expression.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1128360/extras/\u5207\u897f\u7ea2\u67ff001(1).gif?t=1572510074\" /></div><br><br>Some are little difficult, just like the constant struggle in life,  which needs to strive for victory.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1128360/extras/0aea396c4cc0b47c3acc281b94e46384.poster.avif?t=1572510074\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1128360/extras/0aea396c4cc0b47c3acc281b94e46384.webm?t=1572510074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1128360/extras/0aea396c4cc0b47c3acc281b94e46384.mp4?t=1572510074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">We hope that every player will have some insights in the end of the game.</h2></strong><br>If you have any comments or suggestions, join our QQ group 310126344 to balabala.",
